     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black\">Dear all,</span></font></p><p style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span></font></p><p style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black\">With a slight delay we would like your New Year 2016 to go with passion, energy and wonderful wildlife studies.</span></font></p><p style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black\">We are glad to remind you of the <b>33<sup>rd</sup> IUGB Congress and 14<sup>th</sup> Perdix Congress</b> which will take place in <b>Montpellier, South of France, from August 22nd to August 25th 2017</b>.</span></font></p><p style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black\">The website is now open, still under construction, but you can already register to the newsletter to be informed about this congress. You can find the website here:</span></font></p><p style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"http://iugb2017.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://iugb2017.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792475630355000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3jVaJ0wqXdXzZsEbieYOfJ\">http://iugb2017.com/</a> , and the information flyer in attached file.</span></font></p><p style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black\">If you want to get involved in the Congress organisation or in its financing, you can contact us at: <a href rel=\"nofollow\" data-email-masked>iugb...@gmail.com</a>.</span></font></p><p style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black\">Thank you for circulating this information widely to your entire network in order to make this event a scientific success!</span></font></p><p style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black\">If you need any further information, feel free to contact us.</span></font></p><p style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span></font></p><p style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black\">Best regards,</span></font></p><p style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black\"><font size=\"2\">The Organizing Committee: Murielle Guinot-Ghestem, IUGB President, Sophie Verzelloni, Matthieu Guillemain, Laetitia Pouiol, Elisabeth Bro, ONCFS (The National Wildlife and Hunting Agency), Yves Lecocq, past President of IUGB.</font></span></p><p style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black\"><font size=\"2\"><br></font></span></p><p style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black\"><font size=\"2\"><br></font></span></p><p style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black\"><font size=\"2\">--</font></span></p><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Guillaume SOUCHAY</span><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><b>Office National de la Chasse et de la Faune Sauvage / French National Hunting and Wildlife Agency</b></span><br style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><i>Researcher in population dynamics of </i><i style=\"font-size:12.8px\">game species </i></div><p style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black\"></span></p><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><a href style=\"font-size:12.8px\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">guillaum...@oncfs.gouv.fr</a><i><br style=\"font-size:12.8px\"></i><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><a href=\"tel:+33%201%2030%2046%2054%2077\" value=\"+33130465477\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+33 (0)1 30 46 54 77</a></span><br style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><a href=\"tel:+33%206%2047%2079%2047%2002\" value=\"+33647794702\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+33 (0)6 47 79 47 02</a></span></div></div>"
